WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:01.910
- "Cherish The Day" is on Oprah's network,

00:00:01.910 --> 00:00:03.500
and have y'all met Oprah before?

00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:06.190
- You know I met her a long
time ago, the first movie I did

00:00:06.190 --> 00:00:07.930
was precious, and she
was the producer on that.

00:00:07.930 --> 00:00:10.210
So I like met her, in that mix.

00:00:10.210 --> 00:00:13.930
But for Cherish, we
haven't officially met her.

00:00:13.930 --> 00:00:14.763
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:00:14.763 --> 00:00:15.596
- But she was--

00:00:15.596 --> 00:00:16.429
- [Kelly] When was that meet?

00:00:16.429 --> 00:00:17.262
Was it officially?

00:00:17.262 --> 00:00:18.095
- She was at the table--

00:00:18.095 --> 00:00:19.060
- I wanna hear you!

00:00:19.060 --> 00:00:20.275
I wanna hear! (laughs)

00:00:20.275 --> 00:00:21.108
(laughing)

00:00:21.108 --> 00:00:22.160
- I'm so excited!

00:00:22.160 --> 00:00:24.920
- Because we walked in
and we were both nervous

00:00:24.920 --> 00:00:26.280
because we, you know,
because it's everybody,

00:00:26.280 --> 00:00:28.370
it's a table-read and this
is the point where you can

00:00:28.370 --> 00:00:30.380
either keep the job or they fire you!

00:00:30.380 --> 00:00:31.213
- [Kelly] Yes.

00:00:31.213 --> 00:00:32.590
- So we were like, "we
gotta do our thing."

00:00:32.590 --> 00:00:37.200
And we walk in and we see
her on this big television.

00:00:37.200 --> 00:00:38.619
- Oh she's somewhere
else, she's skyping in?

00:00:38.619 --> 00:00:39.980
- Yes, and she's skyping in.
- okay.

00:00:39.980 --> 00:00:41.510
- Yeah well she's Oprah,
she got a lot a doing

00:00:41.510 --> 00:00:42.345
to do and stuff.

00:00:42.345 --> 00:00:43.178
(laughter)

00:00:43.178 --> 00:00:44.011
- Right, and she looks, you
know, she's just got her

00:00:44.011 --> 00:00:46.610
glasses on, she's ready,
she's got her notes,

00:00:46.610 --> 00:00:47.930
she's starting to write things down.

00:00:47.930 --> 00:00:50.410
And we're like, "is this
just a video" and then.

00:00:50.410 --> 00:00:52.480
- Right, we knew it was
real because when we first

00:00:52.480 --> 00:00:53.860
walked on she wasn't on
the screen but there was

00:00:53.860 --> 00:00:57.159
like, a butler setting up
like, pudding, you know,

00:00:57.159 --> 00:00:58.343
orange juice.
- Orange juice.

00:00:58.343 --> 00:00:59.176
(laughing)

00:00:59.176 --> 00:01:01.155
- And she just slid in in
her glasses like, "hello"

00:01:01.155 --> 00:01:01.988
(roaring laughter)

00:01:01.988 --> 00:01:03.664
- Henry's cheesecake.

00:01:03.664 --> 00:01:04.497
(laughing)

00:01:04.497 --> 00:01:05.710
- Hello cheesecake!

00:01:05.710 --> 00:01:06.543
And I was like, "what!"

00:01:06.543 --> 00:01:09.294
- Oh my god, you gotta talk
about cheesecake with Oprah?

00:01:09.294 --> 00:01:10.127
- Yes.
- Yes.

00:01:10.127 --> 00:01:11.073
- Yes!

00:01:11.073 --> 00:01:12.504
(laughing)
(clapping)

00:01:12.504 --> 00:01:13.337
- So amazing.

00:01:13.337 --> 00:01:14.170
- That's my kinda woman!

00:01:14.170 --> 00:01:15.003
- Yeah.

00:01:15.003 --> 00:01:16.446
- Yes!

00:01:16.446 --> 00:01:18.868
I don't want anybody up here
talking about kale salad,

00:01:18.868 --> 00:01:20.440
I wanna talk about cheesecake.

00:01:20.440 --> 00:01:21.273
- Cheesecake.

00:01:21.273 --> 00:01:22.106
Henry's cheesecake.

00:01:22.106 --> 00:01:23.560
- I knew I loved her.

00:01:23.560 --> 00:01:27.237
Okay so, Rosario, do
you have an Oprah story?

00:01:27.237 --> 00:01:29.520
- Well the first time I met
her was just doing her show,

00:01:29.520 --> 00:01:31.050
because of doing press for Seven Pounds.

00:01:31.050 --> 00:01:34.480
But my good story, I think, is being at

00:01:34.480 --> 00:01:37.370
Critic's Choice Awards with
my mom, sitting next to Common

00:01:37.370 --> 00:01:38.480
who was like, "you're mom's looking good!"

00:01:38.480 --> 00:01:39.650
I was like, "yeah she is!"

00:01:39.650 --> 00:01:42.570
And she was like, "excuse me
Common, Oprah's over there."

00:01:42.570 --> 00:01:45.210
So we like went over to
Oprah's table and then she got

00:01:45.210 --> 00:01:47.040
Ava DuVernay to take our photo.

00:01:47.040 --> 00:01:47.873
I was like, "it's Ava DuVernay."

00:01:47.873 --> 00:01:49.020
She's like, "it's Oprah."

00:01:49.020 --> 00:01:50.123
I was like, "okay."

00:01:50.123 --> 00:01:50.956
(laughing)

00:01:50.956 --> 00:01:53.130
- So then we took a
photo, and my mom, because

00:01:53.130 --> 00:01:56.769
I'm working on Ava's new
show, my mom goes, "ask Ava

00:01:56.769 --> 00:02:01.330
to ask Oprah for the photo that
we took all those years ago"

00:02:01.330 --> 00:02:02.640
I was like, "mom, why would she have."

00:02:02.640 --> 00:02:04.330
She goes, "no, don't you
remember Oprah took it

00:02:04.330 --> 00:02:05.320
on her Blackberry."

00:02:05.320 --> 00:02:07.270
I'm like, "no she didn't
take it on her Blackberry,

00:02:07.270 --> 00:02:08.103
why would she do that?"

00:02:08.103 --> 00:02:09.361
She said, "no you just need to ask."

00:02:09.361 --> 00:02:11.648
so I told it to Ava, Ava's
like, "I'll find the photo

00:02:11.648 --> 00:02:12.481
of you."

00:02:12.481 --> 00:02:14.073
I was like, "no, no,
none of this, got this!"

00:02:14.073 --> 00:02:16.897
We'll try to take a new one,
we'll all take one together!

00:02:16.897 --> 00:02:17.730
(cheering)

00:02:17.730 --> 00:02:18.725
(clapping)

00:02:18.725 --> 00:02:19.558
- Okay and we'll talk about cheesecake!

00:02:19.558 --> 00:02:21.640
- I know, I was like, I
wanna come but only if

00:02:21.640 --> 00:02:22.943
there's cheesecake, yes.

00:02:23.779 --> 00:02:24.612
- [Alano] We'll make it happen.

00:02:24.612 --> 00:02:25.770
- Thank you!

00:02:25.770 --> 00:02:26.603
Dreams, check!

